fvNYwaPO4COdrMvTj7CkUkz_ul8BTto8uR_-M8XVsggQA&oe=699ED361"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1061517104420269", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036641_1061517107753602_1383467785716530594_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=siyexYZQCfsQ7kNvwG-FnQy&_nc_oc=AdkLFHQMIbMfoGg3T5kaqONALMsTE91uuT3XQvvhYf91G6BJK2bJdgryWKZSm0_JKSg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftJcR1oy6HIVPVsNqwcAyVr_xFFEA4Vwa6CSKHJGJO01Q&oe=699EE2F5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Screenshot 2022-07-03 20ffff1916.png", "id": "3478847289006005", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974897_3478847295672671_208656237028816676_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QJf08mHJuEwQ7kNvwH2cYD2&_nc_oc=AdnC3h1KJ64tOqtjcF39dSgTzHlVFHknw78zkli1NIbqjiU_ZU5tXUoqJPZsz22mHro&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvAVO_zjZ-hylYfGcwl8TrB_alO9XZHPWHPDder1VdSzw&oe=699EEF60"}, "display_name": "Blockies VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Blockies VR is a single player action-puzzle game where you knock down block buildings and protect friendly Blockies against the forces of evil. Launch a wide range of objects at enemies in this low-poly physics world. Travel to the Kingdom\u2019s shop to expand your weapon arsenal to take on the most difficult puzzles in all the land.\n\nFeatures\n-A dozen types of blocks that interact uniquely with the world\n-A dozen AI enemy types each with their own abilities\n-Levels where you must defend the Blockies from monster attacks\n-Levels with intricate block puzzles to solve\n-The Kingdom where cool new projectiles can be purchased\n-Beautifully designed low poly environments\n-At least 50 levels by full release (Currently 16)\n-With enough support: Level Editor to create and share new levels\n-With enough support: Co-op and Multiplayer Functionality\n\nJoin the Discord to learn more about future updates, and provide your own feedback of what 